= The Artificial Intelligence Boom

Artificial intelligence is transforming the economy: soaring valuations, concerns for white-collar jobs, an arms race for data centers, and a flood of synthetic media.

- @ai_growth: Embrace the opportunity
- @ai_guardrail: Impose guardrails and protect workers
- @ai_ignore: Leave it to the market

@ai_growth
on-arrival: ai_done = 1; economic_growth += 0.6; abundance_strength += 3; progressive_dissent += 3; inequality += 2; educated_dem += 1*(1-dissent)

The boom lifts growth and stock portfolios; inequality grows too.

@ai_guardrail
on-arrival: ai_done = 1; economic_growth -= 0.1; working_dem += 3*(1-dissent); young_dem += 1*(1-dissent); abundance_dissent += 4; biz_relation -= 2; inequality -= 1

We pair innovation with protections for workers and citizens.

@ai_ignore
on-arrival: ai_done = 1; polarization += 1; pro_democracy -= 1; press_freedom -= 2

Synthetic media floods the public square.
